	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&5&lThe pack cannot be finished by fighting alone.&r"
				""
				"The Celestial Core proves you beat the bosses and stood on all three planets. It says nothing about whether you ever &obuilt&r anything - and until now, you could reach the ending with a chest and a crafting table."
				""
				"&e&lNine Seals fix that.&r Each one is &l8x&r a mod's deepest craftable item around a keystone. Expanded, a single seal is well over a hundred sub-crafts, and you need all nine."
				""
				"&c&lThis is not a grind you can hand-craft.&r That is the point. Eight Ultimate Control Circuits or eight Precision Mechanisms by hand is miserable; through a crafting CPU or a bank of Mechanical Crafters it is one click. Automation stops being a convenience here and becomes the requirement."
				""
				"&7Each quest below names its mod and its chapter. Nothing here is optional and nothing can be substituted.&r"
			]
			icon: "kubejs:sky_matrix"
			id: "5E50000000000001"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "&7Nine industries, one lattice"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5F157308530BC060"
				item: "kubejs:sky_matrix"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&5The Nine Seals"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5E50000000000001"]
			description: [
				"&98x Ultimate Control Circuit&r around an &9Atomic Alloy&r."
				""
				"The Ultimate circuit is the top of a four-step infusion ladder - basic, advanced, elite, ultimate - and each step needs the one below it. Eight of them is the largest single Mekanism order in the pack."
				""
				"&7Chapter: &fMekanism&7, Act II.&r"
			]
			icon: "kubejs:seal_circuits"
