		{
			dependencies: ["5E50000000000001"]
			description: [
				"&e8x Precision Mechanism&r around a &eBrass Casing&r."
				""
				"The Precision Mechanism is Create's deepest craft - cogs, brass sheets and gold, assembled in sequence. It is also the item that gates Mekanism, so you have made one before. Now make eight."
				""
				"&7Chapter: &fFirst SU&7, Act I.&r"
