		{
			dependencies: ["5E50000000000001"]
			description: [
				"&98x HV Capacitor&r around a &9Logic Unit&r."
				""
				"The HV Capacitor is Immersive Engineering's top-tier energy storage, and the only one that needs hop graphite - so the Coke Oven, Crusher and Squeezer all have to be running before you can make even one."
				""
				"&7The Logic Unit is the harder half: its Circuit Board needs a plastic plate, and IE's duroplast is the only thing in the pack that counts as one.&r"
			]
			icon: "kubejs:seal_flux"
			id: "5E50000000000005"
