				""
				"Any productive bee's comb counts, so this is about having an apiary that actually produces - and the Centrifuge at the centre means the processing line too, not just hives."
				""
				"&e&lWorth knowing:&r Productive Bees can make &eDesh, Ostrum and Calorite bees&r from a Steel Bee and a block of the metal. That turns one trip per planet into a renewable supply."
